{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Lomasakaṅgiya","html":"<article id='thag1.27'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.27 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.27 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Lomasakaṅgiyattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Lomasakaṅgiya </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Dabbaṁ kusaṁ poṭakilaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>With my chest I’ll thrust aside </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>usīraṁ muñjapabbajaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the grasses, vines, canes, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Urasā panudissāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the vetiver, rushes and reeds, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vivekamanubrūhayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and foster seclusion. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Lomasakaṅgiyo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
